n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Heg.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1f/Heg..png/revision/latest?cb=20220526222731\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Heg.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1f/Heg..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20220526222731\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1f/Heg..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20220526222731 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/1/1f/Heg..png/revision/latest?cb=20220526222731 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Heg.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Heg..png\" data-image-name=\"Heg..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_13\" title=\"Series 13\">13</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Duker\" title=\"Sophie Duker\">Sophie Duker</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_75th_question.\" title=\"The 75th question.\">The 75th question.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/You_tuper_super.\" title=\"You tuper super.\">You tuper super.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Heg.</b></i> is the seventh episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_13\" title=\"Series 13\">Series 13</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 26 May 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Duker\" title=\"Sophie Duker\">Sophie Duker</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Heg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Heg\" was what <a href=\"/wiki/Judi_Love\" title=\"Judi Love\">Judi Love</a> claimed she had said, to hide the fact she apparently did not know who <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> was, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Deliver_a_cocktail_to_Greg\" title=\"Deliver a cocktail to Greg\">Deliver a cocktail to Greg</a> task. The title card is of glitter on a wooden spoon, a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/Ardal_O%27Hanlon\" title=\"Ardal O&#39;Hanlon\">Ardal O'Hanlon</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Show_off\" title=\"Show off\">Show off</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Heg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kuka on Greg?', which translates as 'Who is Greg?'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Skakad - inte rörd', which translates as 'Shaken - not stirred'. This is a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Deliver_a_cocktail_to_Greg\" title=\"Deliver a cocktail to Greg\">Deliver a cocktail to Greg</a> task.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Heg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ardal_O%27Hanlon\" title=\"Ardal O&#39;Hanlon\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ardal O'Hanlon</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bridget_Christie\" title=\"Bridget Christie\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bridget Christie</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Chris_Ramsey\" title=\"Chris Ramsey\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Chris Ramsey</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Judi_Love\" title=\"Judi Love\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Judi Love</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Duker\" title=\"Sophie Duker\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sophie Duker</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nicest_thing_to_put_your_finger_in\" title=\"Nicest thing to put your finger in\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Nicest thing to put your finger in.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Show_off\" title=\"Show off\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Show off. Biggest show-off wins.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Deliver_a_cocktail_to_Greg\" title=\"Deliver a cocktail to Greg\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Deliver a cocktail to Greg. Your cocktail must have the following ingredients: three different liquids shaken and stirred, one piece of fruit, quite a bit of ice. Every ingredient must pass through a head pipe before entering the Taskmaster's glass. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sculpt_the_most_beautiful_sculpture\" title=\"Sculpt the most beautiful sculpture\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Sculpt the most beautiful sculpture. Your sculpture must weigh exactly 150g and be entirely edible.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Completely consume your beautiful sculpture. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Build_the_tallest_tower_of_toilet_rolls\" title=\"Build the tallest tower of toilet rolls\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Build the tallest tower of toilet rolls in front of your spot. After 100 seconds, you will throw both of your shoes at the towers one at a time from the throwing spot. Whoever builds the tallest tower will throw first. Tallest toilet roll tower after all shoes are thrown wins.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>20\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>24\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">28\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Heg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This episode's banter section was cut. The banter section involved <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> presenting \"new food\" such as brown juice, brown wine and light brown sauce, which <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> then got him to consume. The segment was cut for time.</li>\n<li>The episode's title card references <a href=\"/wiki/Ardal_O%27Hanlon\" title=\"Ardal O&#39;Hanlon\">Ardal O'Hanlon</a>'s attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Show_off\" title=\"Show off\">Show off</a> task.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Heg.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/heg\"><i>Heg.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70914-007\"><i>Heg.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141515\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.126 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 731/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25690/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 176/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800464/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.236      1 -total\n 51.70%   36.311      1 Template:Spoilers\n 49.66%   34.880      1 Template:MessageBox\n 24.00%   16.860      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 19.12%   13.432      1 Template:Episodes\n 10.98%    7.709     10 Template:Link\n  2.65%    1.860      1 Template:Chronology\n  2.41%    1.696      5 Template:Color\n  2.10%    1.473      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:2581-0!sseVary=RegularPage!F